<description>&lt;p&gt;In central Chad, a water dispute sparked inter-communal fighting that left dozens dead. Navy marines operating on Lake Chad killed 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters, intensifying security actions near the CAR border. Russia and the Central African Republic renewed bilateral relations in October 2026, indicating continued foreign engagement. The conflict in CAR recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQONIBY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNc1JlMEhLLTRUM28tcFh2LWtZWkdiXzZnLW5jX3Vhczg2aEJ3S2hqemluLTJSamdKNzVsV2s5WUt1VVdxRnRxZ3ctOHNmbnlreFg4S0pDd0NtR1BOeDFVV2FVbUEwWUhsR2x5TkkxLUY0MU5tVDRjSVBDdGtqSkRIUkpiNWdVcm5MRjlid3BVY1BYc0x2dDBEN0p2dE1PUXQ3YVV6cXVhcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQTkVoaG5LSGtmb3o2aGZDLWRBUnlCd1hOV3ZkMkF3bTJNc1htRHIwXzh1YVdqQW9qbzkxR3AyREZYYmVqSEZuQWhSLXpCRXRBazVTcFN4bDhEVy1sdnpLQlVXRkt3dC1SYkVzNk1ZR0oxOVpDMGZhMl8wM0ZNejhKZUtSd2phdGRqNXRrMjRmalI2QV94VGwwbHVMTWl5YVpOd3BQQTJNNlFMRW5pNlVXUTg5RW0ySWVhMzNFWA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channel Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPckFxcE50R29KdmJKeTNmSkRHSXJJdTVpT1BNR3ZsWV9yTFh1QXFpeVdERUhnczZHOTBFbkFCWnNXcWd2TThzOTltN0w0TndvcFhLYlpONXhEQUhRX1lpUnlQVWZFZGFUb3hfbmNQS2pPZTQ1NWFfWDFlRGJqR1JoSi1tdGlyMVhnWHZ4T0QxMTMxMnJqUG8tR1JTdW5uUUtnaFUzWVNR?oc=5&quot;&gt;russia's pivot to asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;N